********************************************************************************
// Sky130 Open Source LVS README 
// Version 0.0_1.1  Tue Jul 23 10:40:09 PDT 2025 
********************************************************************************
The following CDF changes are needed for proper LVS device matching
  sky130_fd_pr_main PDK library
********************************************************************************
Cap devices:

All VPP caps:  
CDF "auCdl" - namePrefix must be "X"

Some VPP caps need "top" pin added to the layout view.

All VPP cap edits (CDF and layouts) can be found in "cap_vpp_fixes.tar" file --
un-tar inside the directory of the PDK library:  sky130_release_0.0.#/libs/sky130_fd_pr_main
********************************************************************************
Diode devices:

Diodes netlist this way (0.36 is the area, 2.4 is the perimeter)

DD0 net044 net045 diode_pd2nw_05v5 0.36 2.4 m=1

changed CDF "auCdl" netlistProcedure:
  from:	ansCdlCompPrim
  to:	ansCdlSubcktCallExtended

** componentName should be empty **

********************************************************************************
BJT devices:

changed CDF "auCdl" netlistProcedure:
  from:	ansCdlCompPrim
  to:	ansCdlSubcktCallExtended

Other CDF changes:
  "modelName" should much the cellName (such as: npn_05v5)
  componentName should be empty

********************************************************************************
HVmos devices:

All 3 HVmos devices (nfet_20v0, nfet_20v0_zvt, pfet_20v0)

changed CDF "auCdl" netlistProcedure:
  from:	ansCdlCompPrim
  to:	ansCdlSubcktCallExtended

added "nf" to CDL parameters
********************************************************************************

